The Shimmering Isles are the island homeland of a people of mushroom folk, on the far side of [[Geography/Althane/No Man's Land|No Man's Land]] from [[Geography/Althane/The Occident|the Occident]]. A forest of great mushrooms covers the island, and the people who live there have a government of their own and a language outsiders do not share.

They heard [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]]'s summons to the first [[Org/Althane/Council of Althane|Council of Althane]] and sent a delegate across the land bridge, the first of their people most of the world had seen.
